			<div class="vc_single_image-wrapper   vc_box_border_grey"><img decoding="async" width="307" height="211" src="https://archive.learn.robolink.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/CD-with-Python-motors2-307x211.jpg" class="vc_single_image-img attachment-large" alt="CD with Python - motors2" title="CD with Python - motors2" srcset="https://archive.learn.robolink.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/CD-with-Python-motors2.jpg 307w, https://archive.learn.robolink.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/CD-with-Python-motors2-300x206.jpg 300w" sizes="(max-width: 307px) 100vw, 307px" /></div>
