<div class="robolink-step ">

		<div class="robolink-step-head"><span>Step 5</span></div>
	
			<h2>Propellers and guards</h2>
	
	<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element" >
		<div class="wpb_wrapper">
			<p>Next, you need to attach the propellers. Their orientation is important! The front propellers should spin inward and the back propellers should spin outward. Look closely at the arrow on the propellers since they indicate the direction.</p>
<p>Last but not least, attach your guards as shown in the picture above. These help protect yourself and the drone from accidents!</p>
<p>Et voila, you have a drone!</p>

